WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.580 --> 00:00:08.790
Service path. Prove it from your desk.

2
00:00:09.848 --> 00:00:12.658
How do I prove a change
before a pull request?

3
00:00:14.168 --> 00:00:19.768
When spi up resolved partition, it also
recorded the acceptance image built from the

4
00:00:19.768 --> 00:00:23.008
same commit. Once your
environment is Deployable,

5
00:00:23.008 --> 00:00:28.618
spi test pulls that image by digest, and
runs its suite against your services.

6
00:00:29.252 --> 00:00:33.332
The verdict names the image it ran, and
the lock pairs that image with the commit

7
00:00:33.332 --> 00:00:35.982
spi info shows for partition.

8
00:00:36.212 --> 00:00:37.342
The same commit.

9
00:00:39.794 --> 00:00:41.874
A change on your desk gets there as a pin.

10
00:00:41.874 --> 00:00:47.634
spi service pin --source builds
the JAR from your checkout,

11
00:00:47.634 --> 00:00:50.684
builds the image in your
environment's own registry,

12
00:00:50.914 --> 00:00:55.244
pins partition to that digest,
and waits until a pod runs it.

13
00:00:55.810 --> 00:00:58.300
spi service list shows the pin:

14
00:00:58.370 --> 00:01:00.740
a local build of your checkout's commit.

15
00:01:01.908 --> 00:01:07.198
Then spi test --source runs your
checkout's own suite against it.

16
00:01:07.428 --> 00:01:10.948
The checkout is at the pin's
commit, and its tree is clean,

17
00:01:10.948 --> 00:01:13.198
so the run is labeled matched.

18
00:01:13.912 --> 00:01:16.722
Now edit one file, and run it again.

19
00:01:17.192 --> 00:01:20.802
It still passes, but
it's labeled unmatched.

20
00:01:20.952 --> 00:01:23.842
Your checkout is no longer
the commit the pod runs,

21
00:01:24.152 --> 00:01:27.362
so this pass proves
nothing about that commit.

22
00:01:28.152 --> 00:01:31.922
To prove the change,
commit it and pin again.

23
00:01:33.432 --> 00:01:37.882
When you're done, spi service reset
puts the canonical image back.

24
00:01:40.660 --> 00:01:41.790
So now you can say:

25
00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:45.550
spi test runs the suite my
deployed commit shipped,

26
00:01:45.660 --> 00:01:48.030
and my own change gets there as a pin.

27
00:01:50.412 --> 00:01:54.422
Next: what happens to my change
after I open a pull request?

